    "bodyEvidence": "Exact manufacturer EAGLE dimension-layer outline (including the two Adafruit boards' 2.54mm corner radii) and source connector/package envelopes, independently of canonical drawing margins and native reference carriers. Sensor capsule envelopes are the manufacturer package/datasheet dimensions positioned by matching assembly photos and CAD. Decorative finishes and small components are representative.",
