    "bodyEvidence": "Exact manufacturer EAGLE dimension-layer outline (including the two Adafruit boards' 2.54mm corner radii) and source connector/package envelopes, independently of canonical drawing margins and native reference carriers. Sensor capsule envelopes are the manufacturer package/datasheet dimensions positioned by matching assembly photos and CAD. Decorative finishes and small components are representative.",
    "note": "Exact v11 board with both complete five-position J1 and JP4 banks on 2.54mm pitch and27.94mm separation. All twelve canonical IDs are retained. JP2 B+/B- through holes stay upward or wire-only and are not downward insertion leads. Manufacturer schematic directly joins E-/BLK, YLW/shield and GND; VCC, VDD and regulated E+ remain distinct.",
    "installation": "Install both complete five-position J1 and JP4 banks downward. Leave the two-position JP2 channel-B bank upward or use wires. All three GND terminals share ground; preserve separate bridge excitation and input/supply nets.",
